OL,3,GNEWSAFairy tale-inspired projections at
OL,4,ALight Night
OL,5,
OL,6,F'Far, Far Away', lighting up spaces
OL,7,Fabove Briggate's shopfronts, is partly
OL,8,Finspired by the British Library's
OL,9,Fcollection of classic children's
OL,10,Fstories by the Brothers Grimm and Hans
OL,11,FChristian Andersen, Leeds City Council
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FThe event takes place on Wednesday 28
OL,15,Fand Thursday 29 October from 18:00 to
OL,16,F21:00 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
